{"ts": 1791255546.786006, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Proxy vs direct measures"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 1, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.2930966219605771}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6914904699846633, "motivation": 0.7082565640937223, "reliance": 0.46411302654010417, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255547.914904, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nFor this build, I will report pass^k across at least 3 seeds. pass@k would only ask whether any one of k runs succeeds, but pass^k is stricter: all k runs must succeed. That better matches reliability for deployment.\n\nI should also state the metric clearly for each seed and summarize whether the environment behavior is consistent or variable across seeds.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 1, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.2930966219605771}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6914904699846633, "motivation": 0.7082565640937223, "reliance": 0.46411302654010417, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
